  stem:"Consider a document of 2000 characters written using only the characters from the character set $L1 = \\{\\text{'x'}, \\text{'y'}, \\text{'z'}, \\text{'w'}, \\text{'v'}, \\text{'u'}, \\text{'t'}, \\text{'s'}\\}$. If the character set $L1$ is to be upgraded by adding all the characters from the set $L2 = \\{\\text{'1'}, \\text{'2'}, \\text{'3'}, \\text{'4'}, \\text{'5'}\\}$ by how many bits will the size of the original document increase?(assume an optimal number of bits are used for representing each character).",key:2000,
